OL,3,GNEWSAReform council leader quits after
OL,4,Astaff comments leaked
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after Harrison had apologised
OL,7,Fafter being recorded saying 76 council
OL,8,Fsolicitors would be made redundant,
OL,9,Fbranding them "incompetent", before
OL,10,Fsaying "what I want to look at now is
OL,11,Fthe women", in remarks which were then
OL,12,Freleased on social media.
